; netlogopy include file: adds the agent types used by netlogopy's
; pyturtle and street classes to any NetLogo model.
;
; Copy it next to your model (netlogopy.reset_base_file(folder) does it)
; and add this line at the top of the model's Code tab:
;     __includes [ "base.nls" ]
; (a model that already includes files adds "base.nls" to its list).
;
; The model must not declare these two breeds itself.  Shapes cannot be
; stored in an include file: netlogopy copies its shapes (car, person_0,
; machine...) into the model when it opens it.

breed [ pyturtles pyturtle ]
directed-link-breed [ streets street ]
